    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>LIST I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>LIST II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>AM Broadcast</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>88</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>108</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MHz</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>FM Broadcast</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>540</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Television</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>GHz</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Satellite Communication</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>54</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MHz</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>590</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MHz</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
